/E (GLOBE researchers studied 62 societies and identified nine dimensions common across their cultures \(Javidan et al., 2006\). They also outlined six global leadership attributes that distinguish desired leadership qualities across cultures, known as culturally endorsed implicit leadership theory \(CLT\) profiles \(Javidan et al., 2006\).)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
