296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (India and the US also differed in the degree to which leaders involve others in making and implementing decisions, or being participative. According to Javidan et al. \(2006\), Americans rank participative leadership as more important than Indians do. And so, an Indian expat leader in the US should, therefore, be wary of excluding stakeholders \(including subordinates\) from the decision-making process. The non-participative top-down approach, while )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
